      "worked": "The HCF is $2pq$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2pq^2+4p^2q &= 2pq(q+2p)\\\\\\text{Length} &= \\frac{2pq(q+2p)}{2pq}\\\\\\text{Length} &= q+2p\\end{align*}$$",
